  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/01/IMG_4036.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>DJ Jesu ha ofrecido esta noche de Rosc&oacute;n de Reyes una interesante sesi&oacute;n con la m&uacute;sica rockera y alternativa que pinchaba en el pub Swing, muy concurrida, en La Oveja Negra Rock&#39;n&#39;Roll Music, de la calle Ros d&#39;Orsins, 20 de Onda.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/djjesulaovejanegracentre/img_4013.jpg\" alt=\"img_4013\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/djjesulaovejanegracentre/img_4017.jpg\" alt=\"img_4017\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/djjesulaovejanegracentre/img_4020.jpg\" alt=\"img_4020\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/djjesulaovejanegracentre/img_4023.jpg\" alt=\"img_4023\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/djjesulaovejanegracentre/img_4024.jpg\" alt=\"img_4024\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/djjesulaovejanegracentre/img_4025.jpg\" alt=\"img_4025\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/djjesulaovejanegracentre/img_4028.jpg\" alt=\"img_4028\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/djjesulaovejanegracentre/img_4031.jpg\" alt=\"img_4031\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/djjesulaovejanegracentre/img_4033.jpg\" alt=\"img_4033\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d